sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as FastAPI API
    participant Service as Service layer
    participant Engine as pace-v1 engine
    participant DB as Database

    User->>UI: Save goal or financial input
    UI->>API: Authenticated request with CSRF token
    API->>Service: Validate request and current session
    Service->>DB: Persist user-owned input change
    Service->>DB: Load complete normalized plan
    alt Required inputs incomplete
        Service-->>API: Missing-input state
        API-->>UI: JSON response without safe-to-spend
    else Required inputs complete
        Service->>Engine: calculate(normalized inputs)
        Engine-->>Service: Deterministic result
        Service->>DB: Insert immutable calculation snapshot
        Service-->>API: Updated dashboard-ready result
        API-->>UI: JSON response with official values
    end
